    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.files\n\n### Description\n\nIt is a very small request, but it would be really helpful to have a reminder of what the help page is on this plugin, perhaps something as small as `g?` in the upper right or lower right of the popup. \r\n\r\nIt may seem trivial but I think these useability improvements can make a big difference. It might also help encourage further hints on the help page. \r\n",
