    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nAlthough I understand the benefit, it doesn't look like enough to justify the inconveniences it brings. Most of which is that there is really no good way to show this hint in a way which 100% does not obstruct the view of buffer content.\r\n\r\nI think having it mentioned almost at the top of [Quick start](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/readmes/mini-files.md#quick-start) and in the video demo should be enough.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
